# Email Router Systemd Service File
# লিনাক্স সিস্টেমে স্বয়ংক্রিয় চালানোর জন্য

# Installation Instructions:
# 1. Edit this file and replace placeholders
# 2. sudo cp email-router.service /etc/systemd/system/
# 3. sudo systemctl daemon-reload
# 4. sudo systemctl enable email-router
# 5. sudo systemctl start email-router
# 6. sudo systemctl status email-router

[Unit]
Description=Email Routing Automation Service
After=network-online.target
Wants=network-online.target

[Service]
Type=simple
User=YOUR_USERNAME
Group=YOUR_USERNAME
WorkingDirectory=/full/path/to/email-router
Environment="PATH=/full/path/to/email-router/venv/bin"
ExecStart=/full/path/to/email-router/venv/bin/python3 /full/path/to/email-router/email_router.py
Restart=always
RestartSec=10
StandardOutput=append:/full/path/to/email-router/email_router.log
StandardError=append:/full/path/to/email-router/email_router_error.log

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target

